01:29:55.812 --> 01:29:57.780
No, it's not a fucking joke!


01:29:58.748 --> 01:30:02.886
- <i>Sam, are you there?</i>
- You want to talk to him?


01:30:03.087 --> 01:30:06.090
Here, hold on a second.
