01:30:07.558 --> 01:30:08.993
You have a phone call.


01:30:09.727 --> 01:30:12.129
<i>Sam, are you there?</i>


01:30:14.198 --> 01:30:17.668
<i>Sam...
what the hell is going on?</i>


01:30:17.935 --> 01:30:20.504
